\",\"example\":\"Fruit not found\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"message\":{\"description\":\"Detailed error message\",\"example\":\"The requested fruit could not be found in the database\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"Internal server error\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}"
